# Frontend integration

`frontend/` is the only UI and owns presentation. Shape Go DTOs to the screen. Change page markup only when the API cannot express the feature; then keep the existing layout and update `docs/architecture/frontend-backend-mapping.md`.

Wire data through thin hooks and adapters.

